    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Yes! I’ve used AI tutors for basic algebra and stats to fill gaps from my diploma coursework. They’re useful for quick explanations or double-checking work, but nothing beats hands-on practice. The AI’s limitations (like over-simplifying) sometimes make me skeptical—but overall, it’s a helpful supplement.",
